    {
      "key": "SARAVALI_BHANGA_BENEFIC_IN_SIXTH_SEVENTH_OR_EIGHTH_FROM_MOON",
      "category": "arishta-bhanga",
      "source": {
        "text": "Saravali",
        "chapter": "11",
        "verse": "7-8",
        "rank": 1,
        "note": "Benefics in the seventh, the eighth and the sixth from the Moon remove all adversities. The verse names three houses and the plural benefics; this rule asks for one benefic in one of them. Read from R. Santhanam's translation of Kalyana Varma's Saravali."
      },
      "conditions": [
