      "source": {
        "text": "Saravali",
        "chapter": "11",
        "verse": "9-10",
        "rank": 1,
        "note": "The Moon in a benefic's rasi under the lagna lord's aspect counters the adversities of a short life. The benefics' rasis are Mercury's, Venus's and Jupiter's; Cancer is left out, the Moon being the subject. Read from R. Santhanam's translation of Kalyana Varma's Saravali."
